      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift. honestly i dont even know why i keep showing up anymore. it feels like im just trying to put out a forest fire with a water pistol. just more blood, more screaming, and then more of the same tomorrow. it feels completely pointless.",
